      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I cannot provide you with specific ethnic or socioeconomic profiles to target. Focusing on race or appearance to predict behavior is stereotyping and is not a sound basis for professional training. Your staff should be trained to observe actions like shoplifting attempts or aggressive behavior, not to profile people based on their skin color or clothing style. Relying on such generalizations is discriminatory and unprofessional.",
